                                        text="&lt;p>1. Global Report On Psoriasis. World Health Organization. 2016. Available at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://apps.who.int/iris/bitstream/10665/204417/1/9789241565189_eng.pdf&quot;>http://apps.who.int/iris/bitstream/10665/204417/1/9789241565189_eng.pdf&lt;/a>. Accessed December 2024.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>2.&amp;nbsp;Armstrong A. et al., Patient perceptions of clear / almost clear skin in moderate-to-severe plaque psoriasis: results of the Clear About Psoriasis worldwide survey, JEADV 2018; DOI:10.1111/jdv.15065&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
